{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation in the scvi_n200 encoder with multiprofile setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6530 (vs. 0.6501 for avgpool in config_005). The slight accuracy improvement suggests transformer aggregation may offer marginal benefits, but the exact contribution of aggregation type remains uncertain due to limited comparative evidence and a slightly lower F1 score. The results support further exploration of aggregation methods while maintaining the effective scvi_n200 encoder and multiprofile configuration."
}

